            p('The holographic display shifted, showing the formal milestone report alongside annotated examples from the colony\'s fabrication corpora. Jonah studied the data streams — charts showing declining Earth-import dependency, heat maps of reclamation efficiency across different sectors, timelines tracking the evolution from desperation to design philosophy. What had begun as a necessity had become an identity.'),
            p('"Key insight," Mission AI reported, its tone analytical yet engaged, "isolation threshold surpassed. The salvage network now: 1) Maintains a 92% success rate in returning reclaimed components to serviceable condition, 2) Has developed Martian-specific failure analysis protocols that predict degradation patterns in reclaimed materials, 3) Operates a closed-loop system where fabrication waste is returned to the reclamation stream for reprocessing, 4) Maintains a \'heritage components\' archive of historically significant items preserved for cultural rather than functional value."'),
