            p('The date had been circled on every calendar in the colony for months: Sol 5120, the day the Martian Colonial Council would vote on the Declaration of Self-Governance. Chancellor Kaito Varga stood before the assembled councilors, the weight of generations pressing down on his shoulders like the atmosphere of a world that had never known free air.'),
