        content.append(epigraph('Mission AI: "The Moon is not just a destination. It is a vantage point from which to see the whole system."'))
        content.append(epigraph('Commander Vargas: "From up here, the boundaries between nations disappear. We are all just Earth, trying to reach beyond itself."'))
        content.append(p(f'From the observation dome of the lunar base, the solar system spread out like a map. Earth hung blue and white in the blackness, its continents tracing familiar patterns. Mars was a red spark, barely visible against the starfield. Between them stretched the void that had become a battlefield — not of ships and weapons, but of wills and visions.'))
        content.append(p(f'Elena Vargas stood at the viewport, watching the Earth rise over the lunar horizon for what felt like the thousandth time. Each time it happened, the sight struck her anew — the fragility of that blue marble, the thin layer of atmosphere that contained all of human history, the vast silence that surrounded everything.'))
