        P('"Key insight," Mission AI reported, "the salvage network now maintains a 92% success rate in returning reclaimed components to serviceable condition, has developed Martian-specific failure analysis protocols that predict degradation patterns in reclaimed materials, operates a closed-loop system where fabrication waste is returned to the reclamation stream for reprocessing, and maintains a heritage components archive of historically significant items preserved for cultural rather than functional value."'),
