        P('Jonah tapped his console, pulling up the current fabrication statistics. The numbers revealed a transformation: Martian-native alloys now outperformed Earth-sourced equivalents in three critical categories — radiation resistance, thermal cycling durability, and tensile strength under low-gravity conditions. The salvage economy was not just keeping pace; it was innovating.'),
