def ch_gen(num, title, character, quote, topic, domain):
    name = character.split(" ")[0]
    return ch_h2(num, title) + '\n' + P('') + '\n'.join([
        EP('Mission AI: "Your grandparents prepared for this moment. You live it."'),
        EP(character + ': "' + quote + '"'),
        P('The alert came as a notification: ' + topic + '. ' + character + ' adjusted their console, studying the incoming data with the focused attention that defined Martian leadership.'),
        P('"Mission AI," they said, "confirm the details of this development."'),
        P('The response came with the familiar micro-delay. Mission AI had witnessed every previous instance of ' + domain.lower() + ', tracked every response, preserved every lesson learned.'),
        P('The holographic display shifted, showing the relevant metrics alongside historical context. The data told a story of transformation — from Earth-imported solutions to Martian-native approaches, from reactive crisis management to proactive strategic planning.'),
        P(name + ' studied the information, feeling the weight of precedent and the urgency of the present. The decisions made in the next hours would shape Martian society for years to come.'),
        P('"The path forward," they said, "is not simply to respond to this challenge, but to respond in a way that reflects who we are. Every crisis is also a choice — a chance to declare our values through our actions."'),
        P('The chamber fell silent as the implications settled over the assembled representatives. Outside, the wind howled across the rust-colored plains, carrying dust that had traveled thousands of kilometers, eroding mountains grain by grain.'),
        P(name + ' continued, outlining a framework that drew on Martian experience rather than Earth precedent: local analysis protocols, local decision-making authority, and transparent communication with the broader community.'),
        P('"Our ' + domain.lower() + ' sovereignty cannot be reduced to a simple metric," they concluded. "We must also consider the psychological, cultural, and democratic dimensions of what it means to govern ourselves — even under pressure."'),
        P('A ripple of activity went through the feeds — not cheers, but a quiet, profound sense of being heard. Somewhere in the distance, a child\'s voice drifted through the ventilation shafts, a reminder that every decision made today would shape the world that the next generation would inherit.'),
        P('The ' + title.lower() + ' would be remembered not as a crisis, but as a defining moment — a time when Mars chose principle over expediency, and in doing so, became more fully itself. The foundations of Martian civilization were being laid not in grand declarations alone, but in these quiet, steady choices, made day after day, by people who understood that the future belonged to those who built it with intention and care.'),
    ])

